# Build Notes

## Issue 1: Servo rotating continuously
- Cause: No common ground
- Fix: Connected Arduino GND to power supply GND

---

## Issue 2: Servo not moving
- Cause: Incorrect power setup (converter not powered)
- Fix: Properly connected DC-DC converter input/output

---

## Issue 3: Abrupt movement
- Cause: Direct angle jumps
- Fix: Implemented smooth stepping logic

---

## Learnings
- Power systems are critical in robotics
- Common ground is mandatory
- Debugging hardware requires systematic testing
